<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-052-A habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.288232" lon="-120.923457"><name>SC26-052-A</name><desc>Avila rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 10.1 m relief across 210 m. Terrain A 76/100; not catch probability. Center 160 ft; nearby 151–183 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Near a source-coverage edge; checked 100 m circle is complete. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KBGELE"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-035</name><desc>Partial mapped habitat footprint clipped to a 225-m search window to retain complete depth coverage; not the entire reef or a single pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.28768700352288" lon="-120.92583472250895"/><trkpt lat="35.287685118181955" lon="-120.92572482143676"/><trkpt lat="35.287775229047355" lon="-120.9257225219702"/><trkpt lat="35.28777711439454" lon="-120.92583242316401"/><trkpt lat="35.288075509494924" lon="-120.92592295330907"/><trkpt lat="35.28886116696036" lon="-120.92580829352168"/><trkpt lat="35.289393708787344" lon="-120.92548430072637"/><trkpt lat="35.28992332871266" lon="-120.92481879861512"/><trkpt lat="35.28987508805726" lon="-120.92201001618288"/><trkpt lat="35.28932308378895" lon="-120.92137214921021"/><trkpt lat="35.28877988609183" lon="-120.92107563991644"/><trkpt lat="35.28818950652547" lon="-120.92098421550597"/><trkpt lat="35.28760278848674" lon="-120.92110574498606"/><trkpt lat="35.28707025899201" lon="-120.92142975813721"/><trkpt lat="35.28652264358346" lon="-120.92212621519978"/><trkpt lat="35.28654340649985" lon="-120.92223563202133"/><trkpt lat="35.28663351718276" lon="-120.92223332878565"